e layer’s transform. When released near the center, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"card snaps back to its resting position.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"Interaction_DragView","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview"}}}